    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 9 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> None<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Cramped<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Empower</p><p>This helm lets a mobile Bastion built in a mundane waterborne vehicle travel.</p><p><strong>Empower: Travel.</strong> The hireling pilots the Bastion to a destination you name, sailing at the vehicle's speed, 8 hours a day, for the Bastion turn. It stops early when it arrives or if something stops it. When you issue this order, the DM also rolls on the Bastion Events table as if you had issued the Maintain order.</p><p><em>Source: Eberron: Forge of the Artificer.</em></p>",
